imited_by: LIM:leakage\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LEAKAGE_LOOKAHEAD\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-068", "score": null, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-068 | Study family SF-APPS-068: Possession Control Index incremental R2 over ORtg (PCI is DRtg proxy)\n- observed_research_question: Possession Control Index incremental R2 over ORtg (PCI is DRtg proxy)\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: PCI (halfcourt PPP + second-chance - TO - transition leakage) explains Net Rating beyond ORtg, Pace, and FGA/poss.\n- observed_result: A R2=0.763 OOS 0.761; C R2=0.902 OOS 0.919; dR2=+0.139. Offensive-control components add +0.005 R2 beyond ORtg. Net~ORtg+leakage R2=0.948. corr(leakage, DRtg)=+0.894. PCI univariate r=+0.863 vs ORtg +0.866.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:leakage\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LEAKAGE_LOOKAHEAD\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- observed_failure_evidence: Headline PCI gain is leakage tracking DRtg (+0.89); offensive-control dR2=+0.005. Baseline omitted defense by construction (Net=ORtg-DRtg).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=120 team-seasons; OOS 2025-26 30 teams"}, {"id": "FAM:SF37", "score": null, "document": "# FAM:SF37 | Study family SF37: Possession-level SQ2 test: proxy engine on all RS games\n- observed_research_question: Possession-level SQ2 test: proxy engine on all RS games\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: A matchup-conditioned PT picker has possession-level signal at team-game level.\n- observed_result: [APPM-017] C gamma +0.0714 SE 0.0057 p=0.0000; B DiD +0.062 [0.051,0.073]; proxy agrees with production engine 13/79 = 16.5%.\n- observed_result: [CHT-024] A +0.047 PPP (p<10^-3); B +0.062 PPP; C +0.0714 PPP, n=16,921 cells, p<10^-4. Coverage: 9,853 RS pairs; 35.7% clear, 33.8% ambiguous, 30.4% no_rec.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LEAKAGE_LOOKAHEAD\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: [APPM-017] Proxy fidelity 16.5% (<70%); in-sample contamination of RS aggregates; iid SEs.\n- observed_sample_and_power: [APPM-017] n=16,921 cells\n- observed_verdict: [APPM-017] inconclusive"}], "n_results": 4}

